erspective, composition & shading.",icon:"chart",category:"ai-studio"},{id:"generator",title:"AI Reference Generator",detail:"Generate artistic references across 11 categories with offline vector fallbacks.",icon:"sparkles",category:"ai-studio"},{id:"progress",title:"Drawing Progress AI",detail:"Skill development radar, milestone timeline & weakness-targeted exercise plans.",icon:"trending-up",category:"ai-studio"},{id:"pose",title:"AI Pose & Gesture Coach",detail:"33-point skeletal landmark detection, line of action, & proportion guides.",icon:"activity",category:"assistant"},{id:"handfoot",title:"AI Hand & Foot Assistant",detail:"21 hand landmarks, foot arches, bone segment proportions & mistake alerts.",icon:"hand",category:"assistant"},{id:"lighting",title:"AI Lighting Predictor",detail:"Directional light vector detection, tonal map & graphite grade recommendations.",icon:"sun-dim",category:"assistant"},{id:"composition",title:"AI Composition Coach",detail:"Rule of thirds, golden spiral, visual balance & negative-space analysis.",icon:"layout",category:"assistant"},{id:"linecleaner",title:"AI Line Art Cleaner",detail:"Eliminate paper grain, scan artifacts & isolate crisp line work.",icon:"feather",category:"processing"},{id:"segmentation",title:"AI Smart Segmentation",detail:"Separate subject from background into an isolated, transparent layer.",icon:"scissors",category:"processing"},{id:"colorrec",title:"AI Color Recommender",detail:"Extract harmonic palettes: complementary, analogous, triadic & skin tones.",icon:"droplet",category:"processing"},{id:"turnaround",title:"AI Multi-Angle Creator",detail:"Front, 3/4, profile and rear turnaround model sheets with height guides.",icon:"refresh-cw",category:"processing"},{id:"replay",title:"Smart Stroke Replay",detail:"Step-by-step playback with speed controls (0.5x\u20135x) and timelapse scrub.",icon:"play-circle",category:"pro"},{id:"mistakes",title:"AI Mistake Detector",detail:"Identify uneven eyes, facial tilt, per